E. 22nd and 23rd Streets).”  Ms. Ash moved to approve on second reading, seconded by Mr. Collins.
Motion carried.  Voting “yes” – all members of the governing body.
“An Ordinance amending Title 17, Zoning, Chapter 17.08, Zoning Districts Established and
Section 17.08.040 Cheyenne city map of the Cheyenne City Code, by changing the zoning
classification from P-Public, MR-1-Medium Residential Established and LI-Light Industrial
